# The plugins this machine installs, one git URL (or local path) per line.
#
# This file is the template: install.sh copies it to plugins.conf on first run,
# and plugins.conf is git-ignored, so what a machine runs is never part of this
# repository - and plugin code never is either.
#
#   URL              clone the default branch
#   URL REF          check out REF (a tag or branch) instead
#   /path/to/repo    a checkout already on this machine
#
# A checkout already present in plugins/ is used as it is; listing it here only
# keeps it in the manifest, which is what makes Settings -> Updates report and
# update it.
#
# The updater below is the one entry that has to be here: it is what gives a
# fresh clone a way to install and update everything else from the GUI.
# Everything else this machine runs goes underneath it.
https://github.com/Fruffel/dsh-ops-updater.git
